OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny fog patches will be slow to
OL,6,Fclear on Monday morning, but bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells gradually developing.
OL,8,FCoastal showers will slowly die out.
OL,9,FFeeling cool, especially where fog
OL,10,Flingers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening is expected,
OL,13,Fwith clear spells developing, allowing
OL,14,Fsome mist, fog and frost patches to
OL,15,Fdevelop during the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA dry evening with clear
OL,18,Fspells, allowing some fog and frost
OL,19,Fpatches to develop overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
