OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FPerhaps some early rain Wednesday,
OL,7,Fthen mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,8,Fduring this period, with isolated
OL,9,Fshowers mainly Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,10,FTemperatures turning colder with
OL,11,Fovernight frost risk.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
